            "text": "<strong>COUNCIL KIDS PRESENTSKIDS FROM COV PROJECT 001 / COVENTRY</strong>",
            "heading_tag": "h1"
          }
        },
        "richtext_yP8WMF": {
          "type": "richtext",
          "settings": {
            "content": "<p><strong>THE STORY</strong><br/><br/>It was brought to our attention that a boxing club in Coventry needed help finding a new home.<br/><br/>Coventry is close to the roots of Against All Odds. Boxing is close to the heart of the brand.<br/><br/>So when we heard what was happening with Standard Triumph Recreation Club, it felt like something we couldn’t just scroll past.<br/><br/>A few people had already started pushing the story and bringing attention to the club. They got the ball rolling. We’ve now <br/>stepped in to add what we can, the brand, the platform, the designs, and the community around Against All Odds.<br/><br/>The aim is simple: raise money, raise awareness, and help give the club the best possible chance of being rehomed.<br/><br/>This project is built around two T-shirts.<br/><br/><strong>KIDS FROM COV</strong> is for the city. For the people from Coventry.<br/>For the ones who know what it means to come from there.<br/><br/><strong>COUNCIL KIDS</strong> is for everyone who connects with the message.<br/><br/>You don’t have to be from Coventry to support the project. You just have to understand why places like this matter.<br/><br/>Because boxing clubs are not just buildings.<br/>They are places where kids find discipline, confidence, routine, friendship and direction. They are places that keep <br/>people grounded. Places that give young people somewhere to go, someone to believe in them, and something to belong to.<br/><br/>And too often, these are the places that get forgotten.<br/><br/>Where councils, systems and people in power have looked the other way, Against All Odds is choosing not to.<br/><br/>We’re not pretending we can fix everything. But we can do something.<br/><br/>And this is your chance to do something too.<br/><br/>By supporting this drop, you are helping raise funds towards rehoming the club. You are supporting a city, <br/>a boxing community, a local club, and the young people who still need places like this to exist.<br/><br/>People talk about wanting to help communities. This is a real way to do it.<br/><br/>Buy the tee. Share the story. Back the project. Be part of something that actually moves.<br/><br/><strong>For the kids.<br/>For the clubs.<br/>For the fighters.<br/>For the community.<br/><br/>Against All Odds.</strong></p>"
          }
        }
      },
